WEBVTT

00:03:28.621 --> 00:03:30.331
consumers across the globe.

00:03:31.249 --> 00:03:33.542
When they want to measure their impact,

00:03:33.542 --> 00:03:37.421
they need to measure
across the entire set of their emissions.

00:03:38.381 --> 00:03:41.592
This means direct emissions
from facilities,

00:03:41.592 --> 00:03:43.511
purchased electricity,

00:03:43.511 --> 00:03:44.971
raw materials,

00:03:44.971 --> 00:03:46.097
leased assets,

00:03:46.097 --> 00:03:47.598
IT emissions

00:03:47.598 --> 00:03:48.683
business travel,

00:03:48.683 --> 00:03:50.017
transportation,

00:03:50.017 --> 00:03:51.102
waste,

00:03:51.102 --> 00:03:52.436
product end of life,

00:03:52.436 --> 00:03:53.813
etcetera, etcetera.

00:03:54.397 --> 00:03:57.316
That’s a huge amount
of information to collect.

00:03:58.025 --> 00:04:01.988
And most of it is actually inaccessible
to the company itself